    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cooler switch (SDK)",
      "description": "Whether the cooler is switched on in software (SDK IsCoolerOn). It stays ON when the heat-sink thermal switch cuts the TEC, so it does NOT show the alarm; use Thermal alarm, Sensor − set point, TEC voltage and the head temperature.",
